  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘、最後までいい撮影だったな\r\nお腹は大丈夫か……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016010160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん～、朝ごはんば抜いてきたけん\r\nマグロコロッケの入る分、ちゃんと残っとるよ～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200401601/2004016010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "頼もしいけど、頑張りすぎないようにな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そもそも朝食を抜いて来るのも、\r\nあんまり健康によくないって、俺は思うからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016010170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～…\r\nプロデューサーの心配してくれると、ありがたかね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401601/2004016010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016010180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……ばってん、テレビ番組の食リポってなったら\r\n気合いば入れるお店の人、多かけん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401601/2004016010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016010190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よかとこテレビに映してもろうて、\r\n放映日のあと、お客さんのたくさん来るように……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401601/2004016010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016010200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "実家は撮影断っとるけど\r\n気合い入れるともうち、よ～くわかると",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401601/2004016010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "でも、無理はするなよ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "それが恋鐘の\r\n愛情なんだな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "俺も食べたくなったよ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016010210,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～……\r\nできる無理しか、うちはせんけん安心しとって～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401601/2004016010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004016010220,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "マグロコロッケも楽しみばい～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
